class=\"views-element-container\" id=\"block-maryland-views-block-local-alerts-page-specific\">\n<div><div class=\"js-view-dom-id-396d52965d25aa2ba80d9895ca0f0e33abc53a1fa3aafad1d4679588faec9382\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-container\">\n<div class=\"grid-row grid-gap\">\n<aside class=\"layout-sidebar-first grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-3 margin-top-8 desktop:margin-top-10 desktop:margin-bottom-15\" role=\"complementary\">\n<a class=\"usa-skipnav maryland-link maryland-link--skipnav\" href=\"#page-content\">Skip sidebar navigation</a>\n<nav aria-labelledby=\"sidenav-title\" class=\"maryland-sidenav\">\n<button aria-controls=\"sidenav\" class=\"maryland-sidenav__toggle\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"usa-sr-only\">Close</span>\n<h2 class=\"maryland-sidenav__title\" id=\"sidenav-title\">Section Menu</h2>\n</button>\n<ul class=\"maryland-sidenav__list maryland-sidenav__list--level-1\" id=\"sidenav\">\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-1\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-1\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/32\" href=\"/housing/homeless-solutions\">Homeless Solutions</a>\n<ul class=\"maryland-sidenav__list maryland-sidenav__list--level-2\">\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/85\" href=\"/housing/homeless-solutions/neighborhood-housing-services\">Neighborhood Housing Services</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/34\" href=\"/housing/homeless-solutions/homeless-services-your-community\">Homeless Services in Your Community</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/33\" href=\"/housing/homeless-solutions/homelessness-solutions-program-hsp\">Homelessness Solutions Program (HSP)</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/35\" href=\"/housing/homeless-solutions/community-services-block-grant-program\">Community Services Block Grant Program</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\">Community Schools Rental Assistance Program</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/36\" href=\"/housing/homeless-solutions/homelessness-resources-publications\">Homelessness Resources &amp; Publications</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/38\" href=\"/housing/homeless-solutions/interagency-council-homelessness-ich\">Interagency Council on Homelessness (ICH)</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/94\" href=\"/housing/homeless-solutions/maryland-housing-counseling-fund-program\">Maryland Housing Counseling Fund Program</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"margin-y-8 desktop:margin-top-10 desktop:margin-bottom-15 grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-8\" id=\"page-content\">\n<div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"summary-box\" class=\"maryland-summary-box\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"maryland-summary-box__inner\">\n<h2 class=\"maryland-summary-box__heading\" id=\"summary-box\">\n          Application\n        </h2>\n<div class=\"maryland-summary-box__text\">\n<ul class=\"maryland-summary-box__list\">\n<li><p><strong>Application status:</strong> Varies by jurisdiction</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Application schedule:</strong> Intermittent</p></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maryland-toc-target\">\n<div class=\"usa-prose\">\n<div class=\"maryland-toc\">\n</div>\n<p>Are you struggling to pay rent, facing eviction, or experiencing homelessness?</p><p>​​​The Community Schools Rental Assistance Program (CSRAP) helps families and students enrolled in community schools with emergency financial support. If you are at risk of eviction, losing your housing, or experiencing homelessness and need help securing a new rental home, this program is here for you.</p><h2>Participating jurisdictions</h2><p>Assistance applications are accepted on an intermittent schedule. Check with the participating jurisdiction to determine when applications are being accepted.</p><div class=\"maryland-table-container--scrollable\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"maryland-table\" dir=\"ltr\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Location</th><th scope=\"col\">Agency name</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Anne Arundel​ County</td><td><a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://www.aacounty.org/partnership-for-children-youth-and-families/community-schools-rental-assistance-program\">Anne Arundel County Partnership for Children, Youth and Families</a></td></tr><tr><td>​​​Baltimore City</td><td><a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://uwcm.org/csrap-baltcity/\">United Way of Central Maryland</a></td></tr><tr><td>Baltimore County</td><td><a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://families.cornerstonefranciscan.org/programs\">Cornerstone Franciscan Ministries</a></td></tr><tr><td>​​​Frederick County​</td><td><a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://uwcm.org/csrap-frederick/\">United Way of Central Maryland</a></td></tr><tr><td>​​​Montgomery County &amp; Prince George's County</td><td><a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://hiphomes.org/counseling-and-education/community-schools-rental-assistance-program/\">Housing Initiative Partnership</a></td></tr><tr><td>Washington County</td><td><a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://www.wccac.org/community-schools-rental-assistance-program-csrap/\">Washington County Community Action Council</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wicomico Count​y​</td><td><a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://wicomicohabitat.org/\">Habitat for Humanity of Wicomico County</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>Household eligibility requirements</h2><p>To qualify for assistance from CSRAP, you must:</p><ul><li>Have a student enrolled in a Community School living in your home.</li><li>Have the student enrolled in one of the Participating Jurisdictions listed above.</li><li>Be renting your home or trying to rent a new home (homeowners are not eligible for assistance).</li><li>Be experiencing housing instability such as homelessness, at risk of eviction, utility shut off, or be behind in paying rent or utilities.</li></ul><h2>Types of assistance available to households</h2><p>CSRAP can help eligible families pay for:</p><ul><li>Past due rent or utility bills, including late fees and court fees related to eviction.</li><li>Moving cost and deposit needed to rent new home, such as security deposit, first month's rent, utility deposit.</li><li>Future rent and/or utility assistance related to your current housing instability.</li></ul><h2>Community school resources</h2><ul><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"847b2991-14ae-4924-bbda-09e9597dbaf6\" href=\"/media/1144\" title=\"Community Schools List\">Community Schools List​ - PDF - 178.78 KB</a></li><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"54230f92-9adc-4e20-9cf5-568d10cfa8ee\" href=\"/media/1139\" title=\"Community Schools Public FAQs\">Community School Public FAQs - PDF - 142.94 KB</a></li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\">Program data dashboard </h2><ul><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiODA4OWFmN2EtZmJmOS00MmFkLWI0OTQtOGRhYmFiYTdhMDQzIiwidCI6IjdkM2I4ZDAwLWY5YmUtNDZlNy05NDYwLTRlZjJkOGY3MzE0OSJ9\">Community Schools Rental Assistance Data Dashboard</a></li></ul><h2>Share your feedback</h2><p>If you have applied for assistance, or helped someone apply for assistance through CSRAP, please <a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://forms.gle/tJPmpGXEzaMCX5CDA\">complete a brief survey</a>. We appreciate your feedback.</p><h2>Contact information</h2><p>If you have additional questions, please contact: <a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#325a5d5f575e5741415c5741411c565a5156725f53404b5e535c561c555d44\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"dfb7b0b2bab3baacacb1baacacf1bbb7bcbb9fb2beada6b3beb1bbf1b8b0a9\">[email protected]</span></a>​.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>"
